      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is this behavior different from Live? I suspect it is-- we did some work speeding up some various bits of network sync, so objectSync might be getting faster than the transmission of NetIK.\n\nIn other words, this is sort of a bug? More of a consequence of us having separate systems requiring sync that have different latency.",
